      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I feel they just need to add in the medium and poor category for triangles to the performance ranking scale. Something like this example, using the existing values with some tweaks and then adding in the new upper limits for said medium and poor. Obviously, I am just making these values up, but something along the lines of this I feel would work pretty well.\n\nExcellent = 0 - 32,000\n\nGood = 32,000 - 64,000\n\nMedium = 64,000 - 96,000\n\nPoor = 96,000 - 128,000\n\nVery Poor = 128000+",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
